---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
const questions = [
['Can I place an order?', 'Not yet. You can explore the collection, build a bag and preview checkout, but this website does not take orders, reservations or payments.'],
['Are the prices final?', 'No. All prices on this preview are illustrative values for trying the shopping experience. Approved prices and any applicable charges will be published before orders open.'],
['Will the objects look exactly like these images?', 'The images are the initial concept sheet. Prototypes and production will shape the final form, materials and finish. We’ll share real product photography and specifications before launch.'],
['Are these for children?', 'The Gubbi is being developed as an adult collectible and decor brand. These concepts are not offered as children’s toys.'],
['Who makes the objects?', 'Our intended starting point is Channapatna’s craft community. Production partners, maker names and material details are not confirmed yet; we’ll share them as the work develops.'],
['Where do you ship? What about returns?', 'Delivery regions, timelines, shipping costs and return terms will be confirmed before the first collection goes on sale. No shipping promise applies to this preview.'],
['Can I buy one as a gift?', 'That’s very much the idea. For now, you can explore the gifting suggestions and try adding a gift note at preview checkout. Nothing is sent.'],
['Does the site save my information?', 'Your preview bag is saved only in this browser when local storage is available. Checkout details and gift notes are not submitted or saved. There is no account or mailing-list signup.'],
['Is Gubbi Art Club the same thing?', 'Same Gubbi, different door. The Art Club is the workshop arm. The Gubbi is the objects arm. You can visit the Art Club through the link in our navigation.']
];
---
<Layout title="Good questions — The Gubbi"><header class="faq-hero wrap" id="preview"><h1>Good questions.<br/><span class="serif">No small print energy.</span></h1><p>We’re building something. Here’s where it stands.</p></header><section class="faq-list wrap" aria-label="Frequently asked questions">{questions.map(([question, answer]) => <details><summary>{question}<Icon name="plus"/></summary><p>{answer}</p></details>)}</section><section class="faq-close wrap"><h2>Curiosity looks good on you.</h2><a class="button" href="/shop">Back to the objects <Icon/></a></section></Layout>
